# Windsurf Rules — Spring Boot / Groovy / Spock / Docker Compose
# Place this file at the root of your repository as .windsurfrules

---

## Project Stack
- Language: Java 21 (production), Groovy (tests only)
- Framework: Spring Boot 3.x
- Build: Maven (multi-module)
- Testing: Spock Framework with Groovy specs
- Coverage: JaCoCo (line ≥ 80%, branch ≥ 75%)
- Containerisation: Docker + Docker Compose
- Resilience: Resilience4j (circuit breaker, retry, rate limiter)
